DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260530T180000
UID:bat-202605301600-the-goonies-1985-@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. A group of childhood friends band together to find a pirate
 ’s ancient treasure in order to save their “Goon Docks” neighborhood
  from being razed and developed into a golf course. And we all know\, Goon
 ies never give up and never say “die!”
LOCATION:IU Cinema
URL:https://cinema.indiana.edu/upcoming-films/screening/2026-summer-saturd
 ay-may-30-400pm
