BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Another Revolution
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260613T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260613T160000
UID:bat-202606131400-another-revolution@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Kat and Henry\, two graduate students from opposing scienti
 fic disciplines\, are forced to share a lab at Columbia University in 1968
 . Amidst interpersonal differences\, a campus devolving into political cha
 os\, and the uncertainty and turmoil of the outside world\, they each disc
 over what it’s like to be thrown into someone else’s orbit.
LOCATION:Constellation Playhouse
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/another-revolution/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Raiders of the Lost Ark (1981)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260613T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260613T180000
UID:bat-202606131600-raiders-of-the-lost-ark-1981-@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Follow the historical pursuits and misadventures of the wor
 ld-renowned\, globetrotting archaeologist Indiana Jones\, who's not afraid
  of anything (as long as it's not snakes) and would rather go by the famil
 y dog's name. Unequivocally considered one of the greatest screen adventur
 e tales of all time! 45th anniversary screening.
LOCATION:IU Cinema
URL:https://cinema.indiana.edu/upcoming-films/screening/2026-summer-saturd
 ay-june-13-400pm
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
